[[48,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nstop OFF, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237587\">1080B92</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and the nuts (1b) and remove the heat shield\nfor the left catalytic preconverter (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013611.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the left catalytic preconverter heat\nshield back in its housing and secure it using the nuts and the\nbolt.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237587\">1080B92</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery terminal (-).</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"]]